            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Weft 1.1.28

- Background restoration now sends recipe and workspace reviews to the affected checkout's pending-review inbox instead of interrupting your current work with an error dialog.
- Saved checkout reviews from earlier versions are recovered without starting the checkout. Repeated delivery does not create duplicate pending reviews.
- Review badges, exact configuration changes and macOS notifications remain available when you choose to review them.
]]></description>
